Keywords: Summer, 360°, Mountain Biking, Bike, 360 camera

4 wins in a row for GoPro Athlete Jackson Goldstone 🤯 With this run in La Thuile, Italy, he ties Aaron Gwin’s 2012 record of 4 UCI MTB Men’s Elite DH wins in a row. Jackson will shoot for a record 5th in a row next weekend at Pal Arinsal 👀

🎥 Shot on GoPro HERO13 Black Ultra Wide Edition

@GoProBike #GoPro #GoProBike #GoProPOV #POV

Snow is overrated anyways 🤯 $500 #GoProYourSummer award recipient Marcus Vanheyst skis all the seasons in British Columbia.

@GoProSnow #GoPro #GoProSnow #Skiing #POV #Vancouver #HyperSmooth

Keywords: Ski, Canada, Summer

Hope those were rentals 🫣 This off-season ski send earned Marcus Vanheyst a $500 GoPro Your Summer award after submitting the GoPro HERO13 Black clip to GoPro Awards via the GoPro Quik app.

@GoProSnow #GoPro #GoProAwards #Skiing #POV #GoProPOV #DirtSkiing

Keywords: Snow, Winter, POV, Crazy

@KilianBron is making his name known in Nepal 🇳🇵 Over 4,500 meters up, with Annapurna in the background, an endless, dizzyingly steep face, and a majestic arch to finish it off. Captured on our 360° camera GoPro MAX.

@GoProBike #GoPro #GoProBike #MTB #POV #DownhillMTB #MountainBiking

Keywords: Himalayas, Mountain Bike, Mountain Biking, Biker, Bikes, Mountaineering, Climbing

The only appropriate reaction to @ropeswingmoab 🗣️ GoPro Athlete Reed Boggs strapped on his GoPro MAX and hucked it off of Moab's Rope Swing for the adrenaline rush of a lifetime. FPV pilot Ethan Knorr joined him for the jump, capturing every angle with HERO13 Black and his drone.

@Visitutah @discovermoab #GoPro #RopeSwing #Adrenaline #POV

Keywords: POV, Utah, Visit Utah, Adventure, Tourism, Stunt

Bike trail or roller coaster?🎢 GoPro Awards recipient Eliott Lapotre captured this insane mountain biking trail for his bike film, Lost Paradise 3. Shot on our 360° camera, GoPro MAX.

@GoProBike #GoPro #GoProBike #POV #MountainBiking

Keywords: Biker, Mountain Biking, MTB Skinny, Downhill Mountain Bike, Bike Park

Straight heat 🔥 GoPro Awards recipient Josh Turner captured this incredible birds-eye-view of Davide Tomasello with his FPV drone set up. The resulting footage of the unique descent alongside Mount Etna's active lava flow in Sicily, Italy scored him $500.

@GoProSnow #GoPro #GoProFPV #Volcano #Skiing

Keywords: Volcanic, Nature, Mother Nature, Eruption, Magma

1 horsepower is plenty 🐎💨 GoPro Snow Challenge award recipient Jimmi Ryan gave us the ultimate POV of his local Skijoring competition in Wyoming.

@GoProSnow #GoPro #POV #Ski #Skiing #Wyoming

Keywords: Ski, Skiing, Horse, Horses, Stunt, Unique

All pizza, no french fry 🍕 $500 GoPro Awards recipient Anthony Robert doesn't stop his ski day for lunch. Shot on GoPro HERO13 Black.

@GoProSnow #GoPro #GoProSnow #Skiing #Stunt

Keywords: Funny, Flip, Stunt

Who copied who? 😵‍💫 Koltin Polinsky stuck the landing while $500 GoPro Awards recipient Seth Shults nailed the shot with his FPV drone follow cam.

@GoProMX #GoPro #GoProFPV #GoProMoto #FPV #FMX

Keywords: Back Flip, Athlete, Moto, FMX, Dirtbike

Full sends only for GoPro Award recipient Jack Kilmain who took the route less traveled down S&S Couloir, neighbor to Corbet's Couloir, in Jackson Hole ⛷️ This insane wall ride POV scored him $500 after submitting to us at GoPro.com/Awards.

@GoProSnow #GoProSnow #GoProAwards #GoProLineOfTheWinter #Skiing #POV #GoProPOV

Keywords: Ski, Skiing, Powder

The powder king strikes again 👑 Captured by GoPro Athlete Fabio Studer and GoPro MAX. Our 360° camera unlocks next-level creativity—seamless POVs, impossible-looking selfies, and everything in between.

@GoProSnow #GoPro #Skiing #Snow #Winter

Keywords: Winter, Powder, Steep, Full Send

A line that only GoPro Athlete Kai Jones would attempt 🤯 The American freeski legend has been stomping it from a young age and he's not slowing down anytime soon. Captured on GoPro HERO13 Black with the new Ultra Wide Lens Mod.

@GoProSnow #GoPro #GoProSnow #Skiing #POV

Keywords: Winter, Ski, Skiing, Freeskiing

And that's why it's called Japow 🤿 Motoki Hoshino grabbed his skis + snorkel for this unforgettable run in Nagano, Japan that scored him a $500 GoPro Snow Award. 👉 GoPro.com/Awards.

@GoProSnow #Skiing #Powder #Japan #Japow

Keywords: Winter, Ski, Skiing, Backcountry, Pow

If you're looking for GoPro Athlete Elena Hight, this is where you'll find her 🫡 The American Olympic snowboarder spends her winters in the Alaskan backcountry, shredding powder others could only dream of.

@GoProSnow #GoPro #Snowboarding #Snow #POV

Keywords: Snowboard, Snowboarding, Winter

Looking for GoPro Line of the Winter inspiration? Search no further than American freerider, 6-time Skier of the Year, 4-time X Games gold medalist, and GoPro Athlete @SammyCarlsonSki. Submit your own POV clips to the #GoProLineOfTheWinter Challenge via the GoPro Quik app for a chance at scoring a piece of the $120K prize 🏆

@GoProSnow #GoPro #GoProSnow #GoProAwards #Ski #Skiing

Keywords: Skiing, Ski Movie, Powder

Lick the stamp + send it 🫡 Irie Jefferson took flight into Corbet's Couloir during the Kings & Queens competition @jacksonhole with his GoPro HERO13 Black.

@GoProSnow #GoPro #GoProSnow #GoProPOV #Snowboarding #Crash #Corbets #KingsAndQueens

Keywords: Olympians, X Games, Freeride World Tour, Wipeout

You may not stick every landing, but your GoPro sure will 📷 Just ask $500 GoPro Awards recipient Mat Cox. His Revelstoke snowbiking powder ride ended in a successful search + rescue mission after he lost his helmet + camera to backcountry.

@GoProSnow #GoPro #GoProSnow #GoProBike #Crash #Fail #Powder

Keywords: Stoke, British Columbia, Canada, Bike

Worth the climb 🤝 Nikolai Schirmer scored this insane spine, plus a $500 GoPro Award, after he carried his skis to the peak of a mountain in Norway.

@GoProSnow #GoPro #GoProSnow #GoProPOV #POV #Skiing #Powder

Keywords: Powder, Skiing, Winter, Skier

No lift ticket, no problem 🤝 $500 GoPro Awards recipient Pierre Vaultier turned his home into a snow park fit for a king + captured his creation on our 360° camera GoPro MAX. This is what dreams are made of.

@GoProSnow #GoPro #GoProSnow #GoProPOV #POV #Snowboarding #Snowboarder #Powder

Keywords: Powder, Snowboarding, France, Snowboard, Winter

